{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "04e625efc9800949fff961c7bf50cd9d8e3c310e03664d99d953c40273b5bd4a", "ja": "グラビア撮影前", "zh": "写真摄影前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6001_p", "source_sha256": "0967ee447812cd798c056d7ff599581e5a38d43bc1dff83f2c2d5bb505017a15", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\nテーマは、犬とのふれあい。紗代子の様子は……？）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》。\n主题是和狗狗亲密互动。纱代子的表现会是……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6002_027say", "source_sha256": "1656890b6a20044b265fee74eeeeb921cec657eff74344048540e04e6ba89238", "ja": "お疲れ様です！　共演する犬達に会ってきたんですけど\nみんな、すごくいい子ですね♪", "zh": "辛苦了！我去见了要一起拍摄的狗狗们，大家都是特别乖的孩子呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6003_p", "source_sha256": "faf9025e3d8b29f50008f2ea9ee3879e91a449810efb2dfae8195b54dd77fad4", "ja": "お疲れ様、紗代子。\nもう仲良くなったのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，纱代子。已经和它们相处融洽了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6004_027say", "source_sha256": "e23fdbbe24195d55f89b5e1b481871501b1201eaa87225cc1d288293e368e4fc", "ja": "はい！　撮影に慣れてる子が多いみたいで。\nとっても人懐っこくて、元気いっぱいでした。", "zh": "是的！　好像有很多孩子都已经习惯拍摄了。\n它们非常亲人，活力十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6005_027say", "source_sha256": "3f4c4abcdadb0f7261f2ca3ba1cd96bb3c91e1b037fa41b27e0885fabd4fb005", "ja": "あっ。でも一匹だけ、じっと動かない子がいて……。\nどうやら、今日が初めてのお仕事らしいんです。", "zh": "啊。不过只有一只一直动也不动……\n好像今天还是它头一次工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6006_p", "source_sha256": "cc70a50339b747843bc6a714a5933389f0964a517cc90c8b1f32d9faeae4ccb6", "ja": "それは、ちょっと気になるな。知らない場所で\n知らない人がいて……不安になってるのかもな。", "zh": "那确实有点让人在意。到了陌生的地方，周围又都是陌生人……说不定正感到不安吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6007_027say", "source_sha256": "eae4c08ad06ef9cd34ca45e1ad69f17c849dfdc977311ee48aa6407dfd18c8e8", "ja": "気持ちが縮こまってるのかも……。楽しいって\n思ってもらうためには、どうしたらいいんでしょう？", "zh": "也许是心情有些畏缩了……要怎样做，才能让对方觉得开心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6008", "source_sha256": "87bb39c17b1aa830355ee6fbb4952c7b0860c5e629979b1dae962277ad2ea505", "ja": "お手本を見せる", "zh": "展示范", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6009", "source_sha256": "608633e69ec64b25858d7d7d05cb2194c96b0df3770146327f90421c27525059", "ja": "説得する", "zh": "说服", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6010", "source_sha256": "1cd6effd1644c66f88b15245e8fdb868e35d4f0a243ad613e35c56fb18f8112a", "ja": "仲良くなる", "zh": "关系变好", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6100_p", "source_sha256": "938938d47363d322f97a2ca2dc3d1746a0bc1215f0e1247470f467bb63ac90f5", "ja": "色んな犬と触れ合って、お手本を見せよう！\n害する存在じゃないとわかれば、不安が減るかもな。", "zh": "和各种各样的狗狗接触，给它做个示范吧！只要让它知道狗狗并不是会伤害它的存在，或许就能减少不安了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6101_027say", "source_sha256": "19bf3438dec157c66ff6e18cd0ab633ca80ec3f53599ecc94a8544e864a09968", "ja": "なるほど。まずは行動で見せるってことですね。\nそういうことなら、私に任せてください！", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，要先用行动来示范，对吧。\n既然这样，就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6102_027say", "source_sha256": "95e9ff096e46b6f291326013135a11fada52d0b96b15724841366e82b26fda4c", "ja": "おいでおいで～。みんなでいっぱい遊ぼうね！\nあの子……近づいてきた！　ふふっ、よかった～♪", "zh": "过来过来～大家一起尽情玩吧！\n那个孩子……靠过来了！嘿嘿，太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6200_p", "source_sha256": "ee57562905f2a7cef35ff5675bb3a026efcc476b86e78b9e6c250d0f4e15ed09", "ja": "説得……というか、話しかけたり、寄り添ってみるのは\nどうだろう？　少しは不安も和らぐんじゃないか。", "zh": "与其说是说服……不如试着和它说说话，陪在它身边怎么样？这样或许能稍微减轻它的不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6201_027say", "source_sha256": "726115b5a7bd988d7388c50b5d8e155fe33a312322c4c8d0a25975924e3b647f", "ja": "寄り添う……。たしかに、\n私が心を開かないと、相手も警戒しますよね。", "zh": "贴近对方……确实，\n如果我不敞开心扉的话，对方也会保持戒心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6202_027say", "source_sha256": "fb58b1c547f9da8f7c537eac5459fce9600aec36217b50c6c8534173ed576f1c", "ja": "怖くないってわかれば、少しは心を開いてくれるかも。\nあの子の好物を持って、寄り添ってみます！", "zh": "只要明白我并不可怕，或许多少就会对我敞开心扉了。\n我会带着那孩子喜欢吃的东西，试着亲近它的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6300_p", "source_sha256": "6958d60407204c777e8d78c7af3ac611af99d5e4e976b83696c7188be87bf9bc", "ja": "どうにかして仲良くなるしかないな。\nどうやって？と言われると、思いつかないけど……。", "zh": "总之只能想办法和她搞好关系了。  \n要问怎么做？我也没想出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6301_027say", "source_sha256": "26c2092cc3f154ad3f760fe55c40d485810e783738570d19737ef65d98681b9d", "ja": "そうですよね……。仲良くなる方法は\nいろいろあると思いますけど。困りましたね……。", "zh": "是啊……能和睦相处的方法应该有很多。不过，这下可伤脑筋了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_6302_027say", "source_sha256": "0c8fb9f629e2f0d27aac436c7c30fb3a9d0e31e5bf5d3dfcb0385a64fa03ace4", "ja": "ここは、プロに頼るのが一番かもしれませんね。\nちょっとドッグトレーナーさんに相談してきます！", "zh": "这时候，或许还是拜托专业人士最合适。\n我去找训犬师请教一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
